      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1772340201783,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What is Requests?\n\nRequests is a Python library used to send HTTP requests to any server or \nAPI from your Python code.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What is Requests?\n\nRequests is a Python library used to send HTTP requests to any server or \nAPI from your Python code.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "lyanij4zpnyZvK-IIJbtX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 46.111106872558594,
      "y": 194.670121303311,
      "width": 742.718994140625,
      "height": 108,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 144580617,
      "version": 11,
      "versionNonce": 1044050215,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1772340234788,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Simple Words:\n\n\"Requests library lets your Python code talk to websites and APIs — just like how \na browser talks to a website!\"",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Simple Words:\n\n\"Requests library lets your Python code talk to websites and APIs — just like how \na browser talks to a website!\"",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "k0767dANTHpYybS8mf1rU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 46.54517364501953,
      "y": 340.6596952941686,
      "width": 589.6792602539062,
      "height": 189,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1719302793,
      "version": 33,
      "versionNonce": 1320687337,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1772340477198,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Real World Analogy:\n\nThink of Requests like a postman 📬\n\nYou write a letter (request)\nPostman (Requests library) delivers it to the address (API/Server)\nPostman brings back the reply (response)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Real World Analogy:\n\nThink of Requests like a postman 📬\n\nYou write a letter (request)\nPostman (Requests library) delivers it to the address (API/Server)\nPostman brings back the reply (response)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "F-BPg2e5v0ccrrgoCrfSZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 53.767356872558594,
      "y": 572.8819374287575,
      "width": 521.239501953125,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1963650471,
      "version": 23,
      "versionNonce": 1206623879,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1772340339829,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "import requests\n\n# Just one line to talk to any API!\nresponse = requests.get(\"http://127.0.0.1:8000/students\")\nprint(response.json())",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "import requests\n\n# Just one line to talk to any API!\nresponse = requests.get(\"http://127.0.0.1:8000/students\")\nprint(response.json())",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "qAf_onsvWw3Hh6XAoIsKP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 52.32637405395508,
      "y": 813.6631537190198,
      "width": 394.6754150390625,
      "height": 108,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 63740681,
      "version": 35,
      "versionNonce": 1730592551,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1772340446223,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "response.json()        # → response data\nresponse.status_code   # → 200, 404, 500\nresponse.text          # → raw text response\nresponse.headers       # → response headers",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "response.json()        # → response data\nresponse.status_code   # → 200, 404, 500\nresponse.text          # → raw text response\nresponse.headers       # → response headers",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
